  "description": "The Gavere Eco offers riding fun on asphalt, gravel and muddy trails. The aluminium frame with modern geometry, long-distance seating position and S-Lite aluminium fork in khaki or concrete grey violet ensures smooth running and comfort. Up to 50 mm of tyre clearance, robust gravel wheels and 45 mm Schwalbe G-One Comp tyres guarantee grip and control. The Shimano GRX 400 2x10 gear system delivers precise gear changes, while threaded eyelets offer versatile bikepacking options. Our high-quality entry-level aluminium gravel bike with hydraulic disc brakes is ideal for anyone who wants to discover gravel riding.",
